WEBVTT

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:25.417
"Human Guardian Army Supply Corps"

00:00:37.875 --> 00:00:41.292
Why are the goblins this far back?

00:00:41.292 --> 00:00:44.333
Zel, there are more than we thought!

00:00:44.333 --> 00:00:47.167
There might be too many
for us to push back on our own!

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:50.833
Why isn't Renlicchi defending the area ahead
like he's supposed to?

00:01:00.292 --> 00:01:01.667
I knew it.

00:01:01.667 --> 00:01:03.417
That coward.

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:39.042
"Stigma of the Disqualified"

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:43.292
"Human Guardian Army Supply Storage Tents"

00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:48.125
Get up. You have to go back to your position.

00:02:48.125 --> 00:02:49.708
No.

00:02:49.708 --> 00:02:53.958
Even if I were there, I'd only be in the way.

00:02:53.958 --> 00:02:55.583
Renly.

00:03:01.792 --> 00:03:03.500
You...

00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:07.417
...seem to be broken.

00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:11.167
Broken?

00:03:11.167 --> 00:03:13.000
You're a failure!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.083
A defective knight!

00:03:16.083 --> 00:03:20.792
Renly, it seems I have no choice
but to punish you to cryostasis.

00:03:21.917 --> 00:03:25.375
After all, despite being chosen
as master of those Double-Winged Blades,

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:29.292
you've never managed to achieve
the Perfect Weapon Control art with them.

00:03:29.292 --> 00:03:33.792
As a knight, you're lacking something crucial.

00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:38.500
Good night, Renly.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:44.875
For Her Eminence to say good night to you...
What a lucky knight you are!

00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:46.958
I'm so jealous!

00:03:51.958 --> 00:03:55.583
A failure.

00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:57.000
I'm--

00:04:01.667 --> 00:04:06.375
It doesn't matter whether I exist or not.

00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:07.542
What about here?

00:04:07.542 --> 00:04:11.125
Yes, this tent looks safe.

00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:16.958
Let's hide him in the back
and guard the entrance.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.750
It's dark, so be careful.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.417
Is someone there?

00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:31.708
I'm not the enemy.

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:34.167
I apologize for startling you.

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:37.042
S-Sir Knight!

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:38.708
Forgive our rudeness!

00:04:38.708 --> 00:04:41.708
No, it's my fault for scaring you.

00:04:41.708 --> 00:04:44.875
And beside, I'm not...

00:04:44.875 --> 00:04:47.833
...an Integrity Knight anymore.

00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:50.542
I ran away.

00:04:50.542 --> 00:04:55.583
The unit that I was supposed to command
must be in a panic now.

00:04:55.583 --> 00:04:57.458
I'm sure there have been some deaths, too.

00:04:57.458 --> 00:05:00.417
And yet, I can't bring myself
to leave this place,

00:05:00.417 --> 00:05:02.792
so how can I call myself a knight?

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.833
We haven't introduced ourselves yet.

00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:11.667
I'm Primary Trainee Ronie Arabel
with the Supply Corps,

00:05:11.667 --> 00:05:14.417
and this is Primary Trainee Tiese Schtrinen.

00:05:14.417 --> 00:05:16.375
And this is...

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.542
...Elite Disciple Kirito.

00:05:20.542 --> 00:05:22.667
Kirito?

00:05:22.667 --> 00:05:25.833
The one who defeated the pontifex?

00:05:25.833 --> 00:05:30.125
Sir Knight, forgive me if I'm being forward,

00:05:30.125 --> 00:05:33.542
but would you be so kind as to help us out?

00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:40.500
No matter what... No matter what,
we must keep Kirito-<i>senpai </i>safe.

00:05:42.083 --> 00:05:48.292
To be honest, defeating even a single goblin
is beyond our abilities.

00:05:48.292 --> 00:05:51.708
But that's our mission right now.

00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:57.000
To protect him, entrusted to us
by Lady Alice, at all costs.

00:06:00.333 --> 00:06:04.000
No way! They're here already?

00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:09.000
There's smoke!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.458
Tiese, are the tents on fire?

00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:15.333
No, it's just some kind of
strange smoke wafting in.

00:06:15.333 --> 00:06:17.167
No, wait.

00:06:17.167 --> 00:06:20.042
There are a lot of people
coming out of the smoke!

00:06:34.125 --> 00:06:35.625
A goblin?

00:06:37.583 --> 00:06:40.750
I found some white Ium girls.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.500
What a haul for me.

00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:48.125
Tiese...

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:08.333
I'm going to win today...

00:07:08.333 --> 00:07:09.542
Renly!

00:07:09.542 --> 00:07:11.125
Me, too!

00:07:19.625 --> 00:07:21.083
I have you now!

00:07:45.042 --> 00:07:47.417
Renly...

00:07:51.708 --> 00:07:56.083
S-Stay back! Or else!

00:07:56.083 --> 00:07:59.000
--You look tasty.
--If you come any closer...

00:07:59.000 --> 00:08:00.417
...I'll slash you!

00:08:14.583 --> 00:08:16.333
Are you...?

00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:20.417
Are you trying to save them?

00:08:20.417 --> 00:08:26.417
Even though you can't stand or draw your sword,
not to mention you can't even speak!

00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:29.750
And yet... I'm...

00:08:37.292 --> 00:08:39.125
Renly...

00:08:42.167 --> 00:08:47.583
I want you to become a great knight.

00:08:47.583 --> 00:08:49.958
Do it for me.

00:09:25.083 --> 00:09:26.667
Sir Knight!

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:31.583
Thank you... very much! You saved us!

00:09:42.417 --> 00:09:45.333
I want you two to stay here and protect Kirito.

00:09:45.333 --> 00:09:47.333
--R-Right!
--R-Right!

00:09:55.875 --> 00:09:57.708
My name is Renly!

00:09:57.708 --> 00:10:01.125
Integrity Knight Renly Synthesis Twenty-Seven!

00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:05.083
If it's my head you want,
be ready to lay down your lives for it!

00:10:05.083 --> 00:10:07.333
It's the captain's head!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.208
I can do this.

00:10:19.208 --> 00:10:21.292
If I can hold out just a little longer,

00:10:21.292 --> 00:10:25.458
reinforcements should arrive from the front
lines, where the smokescreen's thinned out.

00:10:40.208 --> 00:10:41.708
Are you the captain?

00:10:41.708 --> 00:10:46.250
Yeah. I'm the chief of the
mountain goblins, Kosogi.

00:10:48.208 --> 00:10:51.167
You've killed quite a number
of them, haven't you?

00:10:51.167 --> 00:10:55.917
Who would've thought there'd be
an Integrity Knight this far back?

00:10:55.917 --> 00:10:59.375
Really, my guess was wrong!

00:10:59.375 --> 00:11:03.000
This is where your war ends!

00:11:13.708 --> 00:11:17.792
The look on your face says,
"But you're just a goblin!" boy.

00:11:17.792 --> 00:11:22.375
But this is what I have to say about it.

00:11:22.375 --> 00:11:25.708
"You call yourself an esteemed knight?"

00:11:25.708 --> 00:11:30.042
A single Integrity Knight is a match
for a thousand. That's what I was told.

00:11:30.042 --> 00:11:33.750
But it looks like that's not
the case for you, huh?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.083
That's why you've been hiding
all the way back here.

00:11:37.083 --> 00:11:39.542
Am I right?

00:11:39.542 --> 00:11:42.375
You seem to be broken.

00:11:42.375 --> 00:11:46.542
Am I a failure, after all?

00:11:46.542 --> 00:11:48.417
Even if I am...

00:11:50.625 --> 00:11:54.250
Yeah, that's right. As a knight, I'm a failure.

00:11:54.250 --> 00:11:57.292
Even so, don't get the wrong idea.

00:11:57.292 --> 00:12:01.333
I'm the one who's defective, not these!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:21.125
Take flight... Double Wings!

00:12:24.667 --> 00:12:27.625
You can try as many times
as you like, but it's futile!

00:12:27.625 --> 00:12:31.750
Release... Recollection!

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:41.708
So beautiful.

00:12:48.083 --> 00:12:51.833
I said it's futile!

00:13:17.292 --> 00:13:19.292
Renlicchi?

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.292
Someone's a bit more knightly now.

00:13:28.292 --> 00:13:33.500
I guess we didn't have to come to your rescue.
We wanted to take credit for that...

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:37.583
But we did cut off a lot more heads than you.

00:13:40.042 --> 00:13:44.000
Sir Knight, please give your orders.

00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:50.417
We have to make sure that Tiese,
Ronie, and Kirito are safe.

00:13:50.417 --> 00:13:52.083
You don't have to worry about that.

00:13:52.083 --> 00:13:56.042
We just had those three join the Supply Corps.

00:13:57.333 --> 00:13:59.250
What about the infiltrating enemies?

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:01.958
We wiped them all out.

00:14:01.958 --> 00:14:06.167
Then I'll be rejoining my unit.
You two should do the same.

00:14:06.167 --> 00:14:07.375
Yes, sir.

00:14:07.375 --> 00:14:08.958
Understood.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.250
Thank you.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:27.792
"Dark Territory Army Second Group"

00:14:27.792 --> 00:14:33.292
Lord Sigurosig, Lord Shibori, and Lord
Kosogi have all been killed in battle.

00:14:33.292 --> 00:14:35.417
Damn, so useless!

00:14:35.417 --> 00:14:38.583
Just a bunch of dim-witted
demi-humans, after all!

00:14:38.583 --> 00:14:41.542
Were you able to pinpoint
the Integrity Knights' position?

00:14:41.542 --> 00:14:45.000
We've already located the three
we spotted on the front lines.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:50.250
We found two more in the rear,
but it'll take some time to get a fix on them.

00:14:50.250 --> 00:14:52.708
Still only five?

00:14:52.708 --> 00:14:56.500
Or are there only a few of them to start with?

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:01.083
Still, whatever it takes,
we must slaughter those five without fail.

00:15:01.083 --> 00:15:04.375
Okay, release the minions!
My command is...

00:15:04.375 --> 00:15:06.542
"Fly for 700 mels,

00:15:06.542 --> 00:15:08.667
descend to the ground,

00:15:08.667 --> 00:15:10.917
and then, unlimited annihilation."

00:15:10.917 --> 00:15:15.125
The demi-human unit on the front lines would
get caught up in the fray at that distance.

00:15:15.125 --> 00:15:16.042
I don't care.

00:15:16.042 --> 00:15:19.333
Yes, ma'am. How many do you wish?

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:24.500
Currently, we have all 800
of the hatched minions on site.

00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:26.250
Let's see...

00:15:28.458 --> 00:15:29.292
"Dark Territory Army Dark Knights Brigade"

00:15:29.292 --> 00:15:31.833
"Dark Territory Army Dark Knights Brigade"
All 800 of them.

00:15:40.417 --> 00:15:41.750
They're here.

00:15:42.083 --> 00:15:44.625
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Center"

00:15:51.625 --> 00:15:54.000
"Eastern Gate Ruins
The skies above"

00:16:09.708 --> 00:16:11.417
Time-Splitting Sword!

00:16:13.833 --> 00:16:15.500
Air Slash!

00:16:33.750 --> 00:16:36.125
"Human Guardian Army
The skies above"

00:16:37.583 --> 00:16:41.250
That was the Time-Splitting Sword
under the Perfect Weapon Control art.

00:16:41.250 --> 00:16:43.458
Uncle made his move, I see.

00:16:57.542 --> 00:16:59.167
How can that be?

00:16:59.167 --> 00:17:02.417
No one told me that the enemy
had a mage unit of that power!

00:17:02.417 --> 00:17:07.083
I-I'm not sure... what happened.

00:17:10.917 --> 00:17:13.500
The enemy's flying dragons
haven't appeared yet, correct?

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:14.958
Correct.

00:17:14.958 --> 00:17:19.750
As of now, not a single dragon has been sighted
in the skies above the battlefield.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:22.167
Which means...

00:17:22.167 --> 00:17:23.375
That must be it.

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:29.083
That was the Integrity Knights' secret weapon,
Perfect Weapon Control art.

00:17:29.083 --> 00:17:31.333
Still...

00:17:31.333 --> 00:17:34.500
...who knew it was this...

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:39.625
But using their weapons in that manner
should consume a massive amount of life.

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:42.042
They couldn't keep up a barrage...

00:17:42.042 --> 00:17:47.417
Chancellor, we're pinpointed the position
of the two Integrity Knights in the rear.

00:17:47.417 --> 00:17:51.375
We now have all five in our sights.

00:17:51.375 --> 00:17:53.042
Good.

00:17:54.667 --> 00:17:56.875
I am calm.

00:17:56.875 --> 00:18:01.458
Now is the time to seize my first glory.

00:18:04.042 --> 00:18:09.125
Ogre archers brigade and dark mages brigade!
All hands, advance!

00:18:09.125 --> 00:18:13.375
Once you've entered the ravine, begin the
wide-range incineration projectiles incantation!

00:18:13.375 --> 00:18:15.667
"Eastern Gate Ruins Dark Territory Side Rear"

00:18:30.958 --> 00:18:35.833
Mage unit, prepare to recite the wide-range
incineration projectiles incantation!

00:18:35.833 --> 00:18:41.875
Spotters, begin the incantation for homing in
on the enemy Integrity Knights' coordinates!

00:18:41.875 --> 00:18:45.000
Ogre unit, prepare to fire your bows!

00:19:01.708 --> 00:19:03.292
Why?

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:08.708
Why is it that not only the humans of the Human
Empire, but also the souls of the demi-humans,

00:19:08.708 --> 00:19:12.542
are generating a sacred power
that's so warm and pure?

00:19:13.542 --> 00:19:15.458
If the people of the Human Empire

00:19:15.458 --> 00:19:22.000
and the monsters of the land of darkness
have essentially the same souls...

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:27.833
If the only difference is whether you were born
on one side of the mountains or the other...

00:19:28.917 --> 00:19:34.208
Then why are they... are we fighting?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:39.500
Kirito... as long as you're safe...

00:19:41.458 --> 00:19:44.667
No, this is my duty.

00:19:44.667 --> 00:19:46.708
My responsibility as the one
who turned her sword on the pontifex,

00:19:46.708 --> 00:19:50.583
and undermined the authority
of the Axiom Church.

00:19:53.208 --> 00:19:55.167
They're here!

00:19:55.167 --> 00:20:01.208
On my own, I'm no match for the capacity
of thousands of dark mages to maintain elements.

00:20:01.208 --> 00:20:05.333
Not only that, but merely converting sacred
power into Thermal or Cryogenic Elements

00:20:05.333 --> 00:20:10.958
wouldn't be a potent enough sacred art
to deplete the spatial resources in the ravine.

00:20:10.958 --> 00:20:12.125
But...

00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:18.125
If I were to trap Luminous Elements inside
a mirror and reflect them infinitely...

00:20:23.125 --> 00:20:27.625
System Call! Generate Thermal Element!

00:20:39.667 --> 00:20:43.917
System Call! Generate Thermal Element!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.792
We're unable to generate any Thermal Elements!

00:20:48.792 --> 00:20:53.958
At this rate, it will be impossible
to activate wide-range incineration projectiles!

00:20:53.958 --> 00:20:56.500
Why aren't the spells activating?

00:20:56.500 --> 00:21:01.833
U-Unit Captain... could it be that all of
the spatial dark power has been depleted?

00:21:01.833 --> 00:21:05.625
That's not possible!
Don't hear all those screams?

00:21:05.625 --> 00:21:08.875
Can't you tell how many humans
and demi-humans have perished!

00:21:08.875 --> 00:21:13.167
So where did all of those lives disappear to?

00:21:15.208 --> 00:21:19.083
The burden of the sin of taking
countless lives for the sake of one,

00:21:19.083 --> 00:21:21.833
I shall carry it on my shoulders.

00:21:24.375 --> 00:21:26.792
Bloom, my flowers!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:47.750
Burst Element.

00:23:48.167 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "Blood and Life."
